 "vo": [
  {
   "t": 0.15,
   "text": "Okay, my phone literally ate my whole day.",
   "who": "FRIEND"
  },
  {
   "t": 2.57,
   "text": "I opened it for one second\u2026 now it's two A M.",
   "who": "FRIEND"
  },
  {
   "t": 5.53,
   "text": "Wait. Didn't you have a workout today?",
   "who": "KAI"
  },
  {
   "t": 7.81,
   "text": "Yeah\u2026 it's still waiting for me.",
   "who": "FRIEND"
  },
  {
   "t": 9.57,
   "text": "Real question. Where does your phone sleep?",
   "who": "KAI"
  },
  {
   "t": 12.42,
   "text": "Uh\u2026 next to my face?",
   "who": "FRIEND"
  },
  {
   "t": 13.87,
   "text": "Yeah, that's the problem.",
   "who": "KAI"
  },
  {
   "t": 15.44,
   "text": "Tonight, it sleeps in the hallway.",
   "who": "KAI"
  },
  {
   "t": 17.44,
   "text": "Wait, the hall\u2014",
   "who": "FRIEND"
  },
  {
   "t": 18.3,
   "text": "The hallway.",
   "who": "KAI"
  },
  {
   "t": 19.46,
   "text": "Man\u2026 that's cold.",
   "who": "FRIEND"
  },
  {
   "t": 20.87,
   "text": "When I need to focus, I just start a twenty-five minute timer.",
   "who": "KAI"
  },
  {
   "t": 24.95,
   "text": "Then flip it over.",
   "who": "KAI"
  },
  {
   "t": 26.62,
   "text": "Twenty-five? Honestly\u2026 I can do that.",
   "who": "FRIEND"
  },
  {
   "t": 28.8,
   "text": "Then check it off in your planner. Every day.",
   "who": "KAI"
  },
  {
